                        //- a(href='greghemmes@outlook.com') greghemmes@outlook.com
                    p.lead.mb-5
                        |  I am a self-motivated professional with a Bachelor of Science degree from the University at Albany. My experience, spanning from small IT firms to large enterprises, has provided me with extensive knowledge in IT, networking, coding and customer relations. I have held multiple overlapping jobs and internships that transitioned into full-time positions, demonstrating my ability to work effectively in various team settings. I am dedicated to continuous learning by pursuing CompTIA Network+ and Security+ certifications while enhancing my skills in my home lab environment. With a goal-oriented and quick learning mindset, I am eager to bring my expertise to your company and make a positive impact.
